title: "AI Co-Evolution in Education"
abstract: "An open, offline-first toolkit for teaching with AI while protecting student voice, wellbeing and privacy: lessons, an ethics check, class agreements, evidence, policy guidance, planning tools and a library of guides, delivered as an installable web app and a single HTML file."
